{"material_id":"mat_9acf98f85895","source_platform":"aihot","source_kind":"news","collector":"aihot-v1","query_id":"","query_text":"","search_rank":null,"source_item_id":"ybo2q5ug2e71tfuab9m1t128o","identity_aliases":[],"source_access_status":"resolved","author_name":"X：Claude (@claudeai)","author_followers":null,"title":"Claude 网页、桌面和移动端将默认启用 auto mode","excerpt":"Claude 官方宣布，下周起 Pro、Max 和 Team 套餐在 Claude 网页、桌面和移动端应用中的会话将默认以 auto mode 运行。auto mode 不再逐步请求用户批准，而是由自动检查拦截高风险操作，用户可随时切回手动模式。其引用的 Claude Code 更新提到 auto mode 用独立分类器审查 shell 命令，测试中拦截了 89% 的危险命令，手动批准为 14%。","source_url":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2113360845409583307","canonical_url":"https://x.com/claudeai/status/2113360845409583307","content_path":null,"content_downloaded":false,"published_at":"2026-10-22T20:04:24.000Z","published_at_quality":"exact","collected_at":"2026-10-23T05:49:53.502Z","engagement":{"views":null,"likes":null,"comments":null,"shares":null,"reposts":null,"quotes":null,"bookmarks":null,"collects":null},"metric_quality":"unavailable","usage_mode":"reference_only","viral_confidence":"unverified","status":"accepted","rejection_reasons":[],"source_id":"aihot-selected-24h","source_name":"AIHOT 24 小时精选","source_type":"api","source_tier":"secondary","category":"ai_news","author":"X：Claude (@claudeai)","language":"zh","target_users":["ai_beginner","intermediate_user"],"tags":["actionable_update","ai_basics","ai_coding","ai_news"],"relevance_score":57,"freshness_score":100,"evidence_score":70,"overall_score":71,"fingerprint":"9acf98f858954c36a5184be53255ff55bf80d22468046cf6d5e5547142dc9e09","content_fingerprint":"eba9153e54b6bca20237b52ef73a2a4e62f9f193d767b07db52fd80b3a1df3ce"}
